The watch count is incremented when `inc_inotify_watches()` succeeds. If the subsequent `fsnotify_add_inode_mark_locked()` fails, the error path removes the mark from the idr but does not call `dec_inotify_watches()` to undo the increment. This causes a watch count leak; repeated failures can exhaust the `max_user_watches` limit and return `-ENOSPC` even when no watches are active.

